ount":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"yKAOohng_AJl22LgjBPl1g","review_id":"hWYNNStNf-v7_mYwu43yfA","date":"2019-01-18T19:04:58","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9567445516586304,"text_excerpt":"I LOVE Gyu-Kaku! It is a well-known Japanese BBQ chain that I've eaten at in other states, so I was really excited to hear they were coming to New Orleans. If you haven't had Japanese BBQ, it's a fun, interactive dining experience involving a personal tabletop grill and several shared plates. I made a reservation for a small group to eat here for my husband's belated birthday dinner. We went during their soft opening week when reservations were required. However, I'd probably try to make one every time just to avoid a long wait. The place is beautifully decorated, and the employees are super friendly. Our server, Davis, was awesome! He took his time to explain the menu to us and was reall..."},{"business_id":"yKAOohng_AJl22LgjBPl1g","review_id":"uMWc7ONGyf_ReH2QhD81Nw","date":"2019-04-08T21:36:39","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9533399343490601,"text_excerpt":"I loved our visit to Gyu-Kaku. Everything from food, service, happy hour options, and cocktails were beyond my expectation. Gyu-kaku is a fairly new restaurant in town located right off of Poydras on Magazine street. Due to its location being right next to a \"Under construction\" looking retail store as well as the restaurant sign being really up high, you might miss it as you are walking right by it (at least that was the case for me). But once you figure out where it is and pull the door to enter the restaurant, you are going to get a very warm welcome and the host will lead you to the grill tables. Now there are two restaurants in New Orleans where you can get grill table experience and..."},{"business_id":"yKAOohng_AJl22LgjBPl1g","review_id":"ONy3ujJsuxlu03ymama85w","date":"2019-02-13T20:20:49","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9531972408294678,"text_excerpt":"Wow! What an experience! I've always had Korean BBQ but this was the first time having Japanese BBQ. I heard about this place opening up for months and I'm happy to finally try it. I heard this place is renown all over the world! Walking in, the staff would give a loud greeting in Japanese to welcome customers. The service was phenomenal! For my first visit, we had five of us and we ordered the Shogun meal course recommended for six people. Our main server was very attentive and sweet. She loved her job and happily recommended items to us. The food came out in a timely manner and everything was organized nicely. We saw many different servers bring and collect dishes from us. They taught u..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"yKAOohng_AJl22LgjBPl1g","photo_id":"F4Vb_eB_rpThoXpUhu_LhA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/F4Vb_eB_rpThoXpUhu_LhA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8464572429656982},{"business_id":"yKAOohng_AJl22LgjBPl1g","photo_id":"FvW_eLnPrKRuwr_XYIGWJA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/FvW_eLnPrKRuwr_XYIGWJA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8128262758255005},{"business_id":"yKAOohng_AJl22LgjBPl1g","photo_id":"fUDVc10CUnsqbS43tzy7_g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/fUDVc10CUnsqbS43tzy7_g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8004040122032166},{"business_id":"yKAOohng_AJl22LgjBPl1g"